## 3. Contributor Recognition

Only an individual whose contribution is verifiably included in this repository's
GitHub commit history and merged into a maintained branch is recognized as an
actual participant in the Bandi project.

Recognition of a contribution does not transfer ownership of the Materials or
grant any license to the project as a whole. A recognized contributor may only
describe their own factual contribution in a personal portfolio; they may not
reuse, redistribute, commercialize, or present the Materials as their own work
without prior written permission from 김현민.

## 4. Prohibited Claims and Use by Non-Contributors

Any person who is not recognized under Section 3 must not claim to have
participated in, developed, designed, or operated Bandi. They must not use the
Materials, in whole or in part, for a portfolio, personal project, commercial
activity, presentation, publication, or any other purpose without prior written
permission from 김현민.

